2. Red — Unhealthy (Q12020)
Description: Displays the number of applications classified as Unhealthy/Red in the selected cycle, using Assessment_Health_Status__c or an Overall Rating below 2.5 when no recognized health status exists.

SOQL:

SELECT COUNT()
FROM TPM_Assessment__c
WHERE Assessment_Period_Quarter_Year__c = 'Q12020'
AND (
    Assessment_Health_Status__c IN ('Unhealthy', 'Red')
    OR (
        (
            Assessment_Health_Status__c = null
            OR Assessment_Health_Status__c NOT IN (
                'Unhealthy', 'Red',
                'Degraded', 'Yellow',
                'Healthy', 'Green'
            )
        )
        AND Current_Overall_Rating__c < 2.5
    )
)
